  "content": "<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_e2dc6d1b-ad5a-4e3d-b51d-210beac6dd12.PNG\">\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_be45e48e-a8ff-4cbc-980f-3acbf8109429.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><em>我還要感謝EclipseValley和Idk，以及discord社區為讓此mod變得更好所作的貢獻 :)</em></span></p>\n<p>我一直希望有一個<strong>怪物擴充</strong>，但是許多生物和 boss 模組並不完全符合我對「原版」的渴望，所以我決定自己做這個mod！如果品質不夠完美請見諒，我主要以藝術為主，但已經盡力了 :)（並非所有mcreator模組只是重新貼皮，儘管我理解效能上的考量）</p>\n<p>大部分新增的怪物會在所有生物群系依照傳統怪物生成規則 spawn，像「被枷鎖綁縛者」則受生物群系限制，而召喚 boss 需要特定物品（詛咒 Hex）。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em>discord 伺服器：<strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aFC5bjFkNC\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/aFC5bjFkNC</a></strong>(西班牙语與英语)</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><em>Modrinth連結： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffights-frights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/fights-frights</a> （建議從這裡下載）</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>強烈建議使用 JEI 或類似工具查看配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>無法保證與其他模組相容性，這取決於 mcreator</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>最新版本中，所有怪物生成（spawnMob）和部分功能如病原體（doinfection）效果可透過 gamerules 啟用/禁用。完整 gamerules 清單位於此頁底部。</strong></span></p>\n<img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4979f0f0-8602-4fe3-bd74-0eb8c2778e12.png\">\n<p>感謝所有下載此 mod 的人，非常感謝。我非常歡迎任何反饋，除了那些抱怨 mcreator 本身的，因為那很難修改 :(</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><em>本頁為 mod 的維基百科</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>生物與物品</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">物品</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_20223ae0-2e80-44ac-8407-7face5695521.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_590d259a-70dd-4a27-a7e1-d9623bec7640.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_008b7d76-7720-41fa-a957-914277f06352.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_aa8c7598-a036-4a59-8603-4720b0bd0d99.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_1123c358-93b3-4460-bc14-59052a3c209e.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a1b917c8-a7aa-4405-83f1-4e61a83f0bd4.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_93c140c9-1d42-48d1-8e13-c9e5f13ef51f.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_7843b0ca-6075-4184-83a3-8a82de4d7a7e.PNG\"></p>\n<p>*感染預設關閉，將 DoInfection gamerule 設為 true 即可遊玩該機制</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_51f9f9b6-bfae-4ad8-bbd7-0864dbf497e9.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_6ea401e7-4672-49c3-9316-02a685a75af5.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a6d7f1c4-989f-4b5c-b8e5-8be3a5cb9b38.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_385051ff-df31-463c-9be8-a458d64e5ae5.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Terrantula</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ed980ce7-12c2-492a-9dd8-10c416d06d39.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Banshaa</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_fcdb590e-168e-4ba1-974f-19cfdce321da.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Scowl</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a90d4a36-a063-48a0-9924-586319b96263.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a554fddf-d44a-4519-bc9e-539ba2627214.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Pioneer</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_dbb7fd1f-8f23-43a3-a0c1-7354ab22b4eb.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Reanimated</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_beeecf0a-627e-4e84-bc2c-c7dd1a0d1de5.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_5fbe44f6-a1d7-4def-89d1-057e4cb52d71.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">Allman</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ad1922a9-7c6c-4168-bf84-b9f21d63ed4c.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Seer</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_2ca4a7b6-b320-463c-b515-869305e849be.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Patuti</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_85197dd7-d38a-4c1c-982e-127d2f9e3af2.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#34495e\">Mimic Beetles</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_53e21f5b-0764-4fdb-8825-f508e3755957.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Grimmsquito</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ead53c2c-d98e-42ab-86a7-264553fa9360.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Mimentis</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ddc2bdbf-67f6-47dc-87e6-a5bbb8b18a76.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Boss 相關物品</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_09b3dc5f-dea3-449d-b024-914359e81b9d.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_cf3927bb-983a-49f3-abe7-0591df6c7bd0.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Gamerules：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>DoInfection（激活喪屍瘟疫）</li>\n<li>DoReanimated（允許透過儀式召喚 Reanimated）</li>\n<li>DoBossRituals（允許透過詛咒 Hex 召喚 boss）</li>\n<li>ShackledSmoke（控制被枷鎖綁縛者死亡時的煙霧效果）</li>\n<li>DoMimicBeetles（允許在礦脈中出現仿製甲蟲）</li>\n<li>SpawnSeer</li>\n<li>SpawnPatuti</li>\n<li>SpawnPioneer</li>\n<li>SpawnGrimmsquito</li>\n<li>SpawnShadow</li>\n<li>SpawnSupai</li>\n<li>SpawnScowl</li>\n<li>SpawnAllman</li>\n<li>SpawnTerrantula</li>\n<li>SpawnBanshaa</li>\n<li>SpawnShackled</li>\n<li>SpawnMimentis</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_1cda6c8b-73f5-472e-9618-a39461d2a80a.png\"></span></p>",
